#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SVT-AV1"
msgstr "Instalação do SVT-AV1"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Install SVT-AV1 by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale SVT-AV1 executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:97
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr   \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release    \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON \\\n"
"      -D BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON        \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:109
#, fuzzy, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "The test suite is very long and doesn't provide meaningful results. If you "
#| "want to test the results anyway, issue <command>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON"
#| " &amp;&amp; ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>.  It requires an Internet "
#| "connection to run."
msgid ""
"The test suite is very long and doesn't provide meaningful results. If you "
"want to test the results anyway, issue:"
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste é muito longa e não fornece resultados significativos. Se "
"você quiser testar os resultados mesmo assim, execute <command>cmake .. -D "
"BUILD_TESTING=ON &amp;&amp; ninja &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>. Ela exige"
" uma conexão com a Internet para executar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja TestVectors            &amp;&amp;\n"
"SVT_AV1_TEST_VECTOR_PATH=$PWD/../test/vectors \\\n"
"ctest -V -O testlog.txt --timeout 10800</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cmake .. -D BUILD_TESTING=ON &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja TestVectors            &amp;&amp;\n"
"SVT_AV1_TEST_VECTOR_PATH=$PWD/../test/vectors \\\n"
"ctest -V -O testlog.txt --timeout 10800</userinput>"

#. [sic]
#.  test/Readme.md mentions even more
#.       run_paramter_check failures so I guess those tests are just buggy.
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/svt-av1.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On a relatively slow system it's needed to increase the timeout (see the SBU"
" value for tests on top of the page).  In the SvtAv1ApiTests test, 12 "
"<literal>run_paramter_check</literal> subtests are known to fail.  The test "
"harness will download a copy of libaom (even if <xref linkend='libaom'/> is "
"already installed the test harness is still incapable to use the system "
"installation) and some videos as test inputs."
msgstr ""

